+                                "#   heatmap   = dwell-time colors: blue (glance) -> green -> yellow -> red (stare)\n"
+                                "# Simple shapes (no trail):\n"
+                                "#   ring      = thin circle (optionally with a faint fill and a dark outline)\n"
+                                "#   glow      = soft borderless highlight, no hard edges\n"
+                                "#   dot       = small soft dot\n"
